      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think `experimental_` accurately reflects what this does. `experimental_*` would generally have the expectation of \"if this works, remove the experimental prefix, and if it doesn\u0027t work, remove the flag\".\n\nPerhaps `temporary_` or `rollout_`?\n\nOr perhaps `compatibility_level \u003d $NUMBER`, so we can in the future land features that are backwards incompatible without breaking downstream projects.",
      "revId": "26f835965b583fe0b887d4db86c183922bf3c41b",
